WEBVTT

00:03.000 --> 00:05.750
You want to go on a tour of Japan...?

00:05.960 --> 00:10.330
Yes. We'll continue to seek out our typical haunts,

00:10.750 --> 00:13.750
but I'd like to capture at least
one more Graduate-level spirit.

00:15.420 --> 00:20.290
To do that, I've put together a map of haunted spots

00:16.130 --> 00:22.290
<b>   A City: K Bridge</b>

00:16.130 --> 00:22.290
<b>    Danger: SS</b>

00:16.880 --> 00:22.290
<b>  K City: Old I Watergate</b>

00:16.880 --> 00:22.290
<b>     Danger: S</b>

00:17.670 --> 00:22.290
<b>  N City: S Park</b>

00:17.670 --> 00:22.290
<b>    Danger: A</b>

00:18.500 --> 00:22.290
<b>O City: Old F Tunnel</b>

00:18.500 --> 00:22.290
<b>Danger: S</b>

00:19.250 --> 00:22.290
<b>T City: Z Cemetery</b>

00:19.250 --> 00:22.290
<b> Danger: A</b>

00:20.000 --> 00:22.290
<b>H City: D Temple</b>

00:20.000 --> 00:22.290
<b>Danger: B</b>

00:20.580 --> 00:22.250
where the baddest spirits can be found.

00:20.830 --> 00:22.290
<b>Hachioji: Old K Tunnel</b>

00:20.830 --> 00:22.290
<b>Danger: S</b>

00:21.290 --> 00:22.290
<b>Danger</b>

00:22.330 --> 00:26.580
Then, once we've dealt with Tokyo,
and have the strength we need,

00:27.130 --> 00:28.920
we'll take on the whole country.

00:31.080 --> 00:34.380
We've gotten ourselves into quite the mess, huh?

00:34.670 --> 00:35.420
Yeah.

00:36.080 --> 00:39.790
Can't believe you went and picked a fight
with an actual god.

00:40.130 --> 00:42.670
Don't think we've got enough lives
to survive this boss fight.

00:42.920 --> 00:44.290
You did it, too.

00:46.540 --> 00:48.790
I surprised myself there.

00:49.290 --> 00:54.330
I was so freaking scared,
but I couldn't just sit there and say nothing.

00:54.790 --> 00:55.630
Mm-hmm.

00:57.330 --> 00:58.170
I...

00:59.920 --> 01:04.420
I've been fighting by myself this whole time,
all to get my Mom back.

01:06.710 --> 01:10.250
But when you stood there to protect me...

01:11.250 --> 01:14.540
It showed me you were willing to fight with me.

01:15.540 --> 01:16.920
And that made me happy.

01:18.460 --> 01:22.540
So happy... That I picked a pretty big fight.

01:25.130 --> 01:27.000
You're my problem student, huh?

01:30.500 --> 01:33.710
There's something I've been meaning to tell you.

01:34.250 --> 01:34.830
Huh?

01:36.250 --> 01:37.580
Since I'm riding behind him,

01:38.630 --> 01:40.460
and I can't see his face...

01:41.000 --> 01:42.210
I can say it out loud.

01:43.330 --> 01:46.830
Before, I said you were great to use as bait.

01:48.420 --> 01:50.960
But you're more than that now.

01:55.330 --> 01:57.250
You're a great partner.

01:58.670 --> 01:59.540
Thanks.

02:05.710 --> 02:10.750
Anywhere you want to go, Yayoi-chan?
I owe you one. It'll be my treat.

02:17.750 --> 02:20.420
Where the hell are we going?!

02:21.000 --> 02:25.290
To a spot I hadn't marked on the map from earlier.

02:22.170 --> 02:25.460
<b>O City: Old F Tunnel</b>

02:22.170 --> 02:25.460
<b>Danger: S</b>

02:22.170 --> 02:25.460
<b>N City: S Park</b>

02:22.170 --> 02:25.460
<b>Danger: A</b>

02:22.170 --> 02:25.460
<b> K City: Old I Watergate</b>

02:22.170 --> 02:25.460
<b>Danger: S</b>

02:22.170 --> 02:25.460
<b>A City: K Bridge</b>

02:22.170 --> 02:25.460
<b>Danger: SS</b>

02:22.170 --> 02:25.460
<b>Danger</b>

02:22.180 --> 02:25.460
<b>Hachioji: Old K Tunnel</b>

02:22.180 --> 02:25.460
<b>Danger: S</b>

02:22.180 --> 02:25.460
<b>H City: D Temple</b>

02:22.180 --> 02:25.460
<b>T City: Z Cemetery</b>

02:22.180 --> 02:25.460
<b>Danger: A</b>

02:22.180 --> 02:25.460
<b>Danger: B</b>

02:26.630 --> 02:31.380
This spot was on both the Tokyo list and the national list,

02:32.130 --> 02:35.830
<b>Tokyo</b>

02:32.170 --> 02:34.330
cause it's one of the worst places out there...

02:33.290 --> 02:35.830
<b>Danger:</b>

02:34.540 --> 02:35.830
<b>S</b>

02:44.920 --> 02:46.750
Are ya ready, Keitaro?

02:47.330 --> 02:49.080
Let's ghooo...

02:50.960 --> 02:52.710
...ooost...

04:33.250 --> 04:37.210
This is one of the worst places in Japan...

04:38.420 --> 04:43.130
The Castle H Ruins, Danger Rank S!

04:44.080 --> 04:45.000
Keitaro.

04:46.080 --> 04:48.790
Let me tell you what's special about S-Ranks.

04:50.000 --> 04:56.380
Every S-Rank spot can either trap you in there forever,

04:56.960 --> 05:00.750
or give you a curse that'll follow you forever.

05:03.330 --> 05:06.170
H-how do you know that though?

05:07.830 --> 05:08.880
Experience.

05:09.670 --> 05:11.040
Experience?!

05:19.710 --> 05:22.000
This place is unlike anywhere we’ve ever been...

05:23.170 --> 05:26.670
There's this pressure in the air that makes every breath
feel like you're inhaling water...

05:28.130 --> 05:31.040
But... I'm okay!

05:31.580 --> 05:33.210
We've made it through everything else!

05:40.330 --> 05:44.920
No matter what happens, we can handle it!

05:45.710 --> 05:50.250
That's right. If a baddie attacks, we just gotta catch it.

05:52.210 --> 05:52.960
Let's go.

05:53.670 --> 05:54.210
Yeah!

06:18.500 --> 06:21.040
Y'know, according to what I'm reading,

06:21.330 --> 06:25.080
this place might just house
a really powerful but harmless spirit.

06:26.330 --> 06:29.330
Wait, isn't this place Rank S? What makes you say that?

06:29.710 --> 06:32.710
In all the stories I read,
no one mentioned anyone dying here.

06:34.080 --> 06:37.750
Wait, so we don't have to worry about
getting killed, either?

06:38.330 --> 06:41.540
Seems like people come by here
on a regular basis to tour the ruins.

06:42.000 --> 06:47.040
<b>CASTLE RUINS NATURE PARK</b>

06:42.670 --> 06:45.170
The spirit must single out those
who aren't here to learn about history

06:45.170 --> 06:49.540
and scares them away to make sure
they never come back.

06:47.040 --> 06:51.250
<b>CASTLE HISTORY</b>

06:51.250 --> 06:54.000
Though that's just my speculation.

06:54.670 --> 06:56.580
We'll have to see for ourselves.

06:58.000 --> 07:02.040
For starters, let's check out the waterfall.
Apparently, that's the 'scariest' spot.

07:03.330 --> 07:08.460
The entrance is just a little behind us.
Let's head there first.

07:10.040 --> 07:13.830
We're gonna catch ourselves a Graduate-tier spirit today.

07:14.630 --> 07:15.290
Say it with me-

07:25.170 --> 07:28.210
An old lady? At this time of night?

07:28.460 --> 07:30.250
You here to tour?

07:30.500 --> 07:32.170
We want to go see the waterfall.

07:32.170 --> 07:33.000
Hold on!

07:33.210 --> 07:35.130
Yayoi-chan, we can't just...

07:35.130 --> 07:36.580
The waterfall?

07:39.710 --> 07:41.420
I'll take ya there.

07:44.210 --> 07:45.080
Read this.

07:46.670 --> 07:48.290
These are the stories about this place.

07:49.630 --> 07:52.330
Close encounters at Castle H...

07:53.960 --> 08:00.710
One: You spot warriors, servant women,
and children walking in a large group.

08:01.670 --> 08:05.750
Two: You hear footsteps behind you.

08:06.290 --> 08:09.880
More and more spirits join them,
and the sound follows you home.

08:10.960 --> 08:17.630
Three: Near the waterfall and the castle ruins,
you feel the presence of many spirits.

08:18.420 --> 08:22.540
You feel their eyes on you,
and hear the moaning and crying of young women.

08:24.000 --> 08:32.130
Four: You hear the ringing of a Buddhist staff,
a high-pitched flute, and pounding drums.

08:33.790 --> 08:38.960
Five: You feel an extremely strong presence
at the top of the waterfall.

08:40.080 --> 08:43.250
<b>Six:</b>

08:40.080 --> 08:43.250
<b>You encounter an old woman,</b>

08:40.090 --> 08:43.250
<b>even late into the night</b>

08:40.960 --> 08:46.290
Six: You encounter an old woman,
even late into the night.

08:48.790 --> 08:50.000
An old woman...

08:50.790 --> 08:52.500
We're past speculation now.

08:53.670 --> 08:55.130
We're already in it.

08:57.080 --> 09:00.500
If she's gonna show us the way,
we might as well follow her.

09:07.420 --> 09:11.170
It's a terribly tragic place.

09:13.460 --> 09:14.540
The waterfall?

09:15.420 --> 09:17.500
I'll tell you the story.

09:18.210 --> 09:24.790
In the late 1500s, this castle was sieged
and conquered in the span of a single day.

09:26.080 --> 09:33.250
The garrison of a thousand men rushed out
to fight the invading army of fifteen thousand.

09:33.670 --> 09:40.710
With their army deployed elsewhere,
only non-combatants remained within the castle walls.

09:40.710 --> 09:44.210
But they were not allowed to surrender.

09:45.080 --> 09:55.710
They beheaded the women and put their heads
on display to torment the army upon their reutrn.

09:56.460 --> 10:01.080
And so, they carried out their slaughter.

10:02.330 --> 10:06.540
Not wanting to be discovered
in such a state by their loved ones,

10:06.880 --> 10:09.920
the surviving women slit their own throats,

10:11.380 --> 10:14.130
then threw themselves off the top of the waterfall.

10:15.420 --> 10:23.040
Their blood stained the river's waters red
for three days and nights.

10:23.330 --> 10:27.580
That is the story of our waterfall.

10:29.960 --> 10:33.250
Y..Yayoi-chan, this doesn't feel right...

10:33.750 --> 10:37.130
This time, we're the ones on the offensive.

10:38.380 --> 10:41.540
But we're doing this for a reason.

10:45.290 --> 10:47.920
For the people whose lives we can still save.

10:49.960 --> 10:52.790
We will devour the wicked and cleave apart evil.

10:53.920 --> 10:55.250
With that said...

10:55.750 --> 10:56.420
Here.

10:56.710 --> 10:57.460
Huh?

10:58.750 --> 11:04.080
Even benevolent spirits might try to kill us.
Take that for self-defense.

11:05.710 --> 11:06.880
I've got these.

11:08.330 --> 11:09.670
The Graduate...

11:09.880 --> 11:15.540
And the finger of Kishimojin? It survived the fighting?

11:25.960 --> 11:26.830
What is it?

11:27.540 --> 11:32.830
I don't know. I felt like something
was creeping up behind us.

11:34.290 --> 11:35.420
I don't see anything.

11:37.040 --> 11:40.960
But it's hard to see anything, even spirits,
when it's this dark out.

11:41.670 --> 11:44.210
If you feel anything off, tell me right away.

11:44.960 --> 11:45.750
Okay.

11:46.750 --> 11:49.710
What're you two stopping for?

11:50.080 --> 11:51.960
Huh? Sorry.

11:58.420 --> 12:04.040
Wait, I just heard footsteps coming from behind me
that sounded like the old lady's...

12:07.130 --> 12:09.330
Or am I just hearing things?

12:26.000 --> 12:30.380
Yayoi-chan, it's pretty dark.
Let's hold hands so we can stay safe.

12:50.710 --> 12:51.830
Keitaro...

12:52.500 --> 12:53.960
...you're acting weird.

13:10.710 --> 13:13.080
They're gone?

13:19.630 --> 13:22.830
This time, I know I heard that!

13:24.380 --> 13:27.210
It's a nice spirit, right?

13:28.920 --> 13:30.170
Was she sure?

13:36.540 --> 13:38.750
Y..Yayoi-chan!

13:39.380 --> 13:40.830
I gotta find her!

14:18.960 --> 14:22.380
I wonder what Kei-kun's up to!

14:29.040 --> 14:30.210
Why's it not working?

14:33.630 --> 14:35.580
Yayoi-chan!

14:38.330 --> 14:41.460
Yayoi-chan? Yayoi-chan!

14:48.710 --> 14:51.040
Why're you smiling like that?

14:52.540 --> 14:55.710
Usually, you're scared out of your mind.

15:06.880 --> 15:09.130
Something feels wrong.

15:22.170 --> 15:24.580
You look delicious.

15:30.130 --> 15:31.000
Focus!

15:31.670 --> 15:35.130
Try to find the horrible aura of her Graduate!

15:36.790 --> 15:39.830
I have to find her. She's counting on me!

15:40.830 --> 15:41.920
I'm her partner!

15:52.500 --> 15:58.790
I'm imagining things. I can't normally see spirits.

16:07.170 --> 16:09.330
They're all around me!

16:14.000 --> 16:15.040
I gotta run...

16:17.880 --> 16:20.580
I-I'm paralyzed!

16:30.170 --> 16:34.750
No, I'm not... They're controlling me!

16:38.500 --> 16:40.000
Don't forget.

16:41.420 --> 16:42.880
Don't forget.

16:56.710 --> 16:57.790
What is this...?

17:55.710 --> 17:57.040
Don't forget.

17:57.540 --> 17:59.920
Carve it into your mind!

18:07.670 --> 18:09.920
What was that? An illusion?

18:36.960 --> 18:40.920
They cut through the doll and got to me...

18:42.500 --> 18:43.830
With a curse...

18:57.460 --> 18:59.460
Yayoi-chan! Yayoi-chan!

19:01.460 --> 19:02.330
Yayoi-chan!

19:05.960 --> 19:08.080
YAYOI-CHAN!

19:11.040 --> 19:12.880
Wait, Yayoi-chan!

19:21.420 --> 19:22.540
A hill...

19:30.500 --> 19:33.920
Before, I said you were great to use as bait.

19:34.250 --> 19:36.790
But you're more than that now.

19:39.790 --> 19:41.750
You're a great partner.

19:48.080 --> 19:49.130
Keitaro!

20:04.750 --> 20:06.920
Yayoi-chan? Yayoi-chan!

20:07.170 --> 20:10.750
Yayoi-chan! Yayoi-chan! Yayoi-chan!

20:11.290 --> 20:12.580
Yayoi-chan...

20:12.790 --> 20:14.210
Don't forget.

20:21.290 --> 20:24.380
The waterfall? How did I get here?

20:50.000 --> 20:51.710
Don't forget.

20:52.920 --> 20:55.540
I'll carve it into your mind...

20:58.290 --> 21:05.170
...so you'll stay here forever, even after death...

21:06.130 --> 21:08.960
It can trap you in here forever.

21:11.710 --> 21:13.670
I let my guard down.

21:15.080 --> 21:19.330
If I'd been more careful, I wouldn't have ended up cursed.

21:21.040 --> 21:23.420
And then...

21:25.250 --> 21:28.250
...Yayoi-chan would still be alive.

21:33.130 --> 21:37.210
How do I get out of this... Yayoi-chan?

23:22.210 --> 23:28.580
With Yayoi already taken by the S-Rank curse,
Keitaro is left to fend for himself.

23:30.080 --> 23:36.000
But to defeat this overpowered enemy,
he'll need an overpowered ally,

23:36.580 --> 23:39.000
of which only one remains to him...
